  _isModifiedAbility: 1
  _modifiedFrom: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1310816c9d61694d8a5d4f99982f53e, type: 2}
  _description: 'Effect: Instead of performing a standard dash, Nikita swaps positions
    with an ally within 2 tiles. She retains the +5% Dodge bonus and gains 1 Swift
    Cutlery stack, but loses the +10% Accuracy bonus.


    Explanation: Allows Nikita
    to reposition teammates out of danger or place herself in an advantageous position.
    Particularly useful against bosses with telegraphed attacks or when protecting
    vulnerable allies. '
